@startuml Admin_TourMap_Management_SSD

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UI: Tour Map" as UI
participant "Database" as DB
participant "S3 Storage" as S3

== View Tour Map ==

Admin -> UI: Access tour map management
activate UI
UI -> DB: Fetch active pins
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return pins list
deactivate DB
UI -> DB: Fetch archived pins
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return archived pins
deactivate DB
UI -> DB: Fetch categories
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return categories
deactivate DB
UI --> Admin: Display map with pins (Active/Archived tabs)
deactivate UI

== Add Pin ==

Admin -> UI: Click on map or enter coordinates
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Display pin form
Admin -> UI: Enter details (name, description, category,\nfacade, media, 3D model, fees)
UI -> UI: Validate (all fields required)
alt Input valid
    UI --> Admin: Show confirmation
    Admin -> UI: Confirm add
    UI -> S3: Upload facade image
    activate S3
    S3 --> UI: Return S3 URL
    deactivate S3
    UI -> S3: Upload media files
    activate S3
    S3 --> UI: Return S3 URLs
    deactivate S3
    alt 3D model uploaded
        UI -> S3: Upload GLB file
        activate S3
        S3 --> UI: Return S3 URL
        deactivate S3
    end
    UI -> DB: Save pin record
    activate DB
    DB --> UI: Pin created
    deactivate DB
    UI --> Admin: Success, refresh map
else Input invalid
    UI --> Admin: Show errors
end
deactivate UI

== Edit Pin ==

Admin -> UI: Click pin on map
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Display pin details
Admin -> UI: Click "Edit"
UI --> Admin: Show edit form
Admin -> UI: Modify details
UI --> Admin: Show confirmation
Admin -> UI: Confirm update
alt New files uploaded
    UI -> S3: Delete old files
    activate S3
    deactivate S3
    UI -> S3: Upload new files
    activate S3
    S3 --> UI: Return URLs
    deactivate S3
end
UI -> DB: Update pin record
activate DB
DB --> UI: Pin updated
deactivate DB
UI --> Admin: Success, refresh map
deactivate UI

== Manage Categories ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Categories"
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Show category panel
Admin -> UI: Add/Edit/Delete category
UI --> Admin: Show confirmation
Admin -> UI: Confirm
UI -> DB: Save/Update/Delete category
activate DB
DB --> UI: Success
deactivate DB
UI --> Admin: Refresh categories
deactivate UI

== Archive Pin ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Archive"
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Show confirmation
Admin -> UI: Confirm
UI -> DB: Update pin (archived: true)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Pin archived
deactivate DB
UI --> Admin: Refresh lists
deactivate UI

== Restore Pin ==

Admin -> UI: Switch to Archived tab
activate UI
Admin -> UI: Click "Restore"
UI --> Admin: Show confirmation
Admin -> UI: Confirm
UI -> DB: Update pin (archived: false)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Pin restored
deactivate DB
UI --> Admin: Refresh lists
deactivate UI

== Delete Pin ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Delete" (archived pin)
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Show warning
Admin -> UI: Confirm
UI -> S3: Delete all files (facade, media, 3D model)
activate S3
deactivate S3
UI -> DB: Remove pin record
activate DB
DB --> UI: Pin deleted
deactivate DB
UI --> Admin: Refresh archived list
deactivate UI

@enduml
